# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
*.swp
*~

# Scratch output from headless capture and local probing.
# These are rooted with a leading "/" on purpose. An unanchored `t*.js` matches
# at ANY depth — it silently excluded data/transit-data.js for an entire release,
# which shipped a deployed site with no dataset and no buses in it. Scratch
# patterns must never be able to reach into the app.
/.shots/
/demo/gallery-preview.png
/demo/audit.html
/tests/debug.log
/probe*.js
/t*.js

# Generated SSH material for pushing this repo. A public key is not secret, but
# it is machine-specific and has no business in the project history.
SSH_KEY_TO_ADD.pub

# Defensive: the app is useless without its data. If a rule is ever added that
# would exclude it, this keeps it tracked and makes the mistake visible.
!data/
!data/**

# Nothing here is generated by a build step, so there is no dist/ or
# node_modules/ to ignore — the app has no dependencies by design.
